-msgid ""
-"<p>Open Settings → Import → <b>Lotus Organizer (.or6 / .csv) …</b> and "
-"select an OR6 file or CSV export. OR6 imports basic appointments, tasks, "
-"contacts and note text. Series, groups and other sections are skipped; "
-"layout, attachments, categories and alarms are not transferred. Read the "
-"import report. For CSV, export each desired section in Lotus using File → "
-"Export → Delimited ASCII/CSV, then import each file separately. The original "
-"is read only. The file limit is 32 MiB; ZIP imports also have entry and size "
-"limits.</p>"
-msgstr ""
-"<p>Åbn indstillinger → import → <b>Lotus Organizer (.or6 / .csv) …</b> og "
-"vælg en OR6- eller CSV-fil. OR6 importerer almindelige aftaler, opgaver, "
-"kontakter og notetekst. Gentagelser, grupper og andre afsnit springes over; "
-"layout, vedhæftninger, kategorier og alarmer overføres ikke. Læs "
-"importrapporten. Eksportér hvert ønsket afsnit fra Lotus via Filer → "
-"Eksportér → Afgrænset ASCII/CSV, og importér CSV-filerne enkeltvis. "
-"Originalen læses kun. Grænse: 32 MiB; ZIP har ekstra grænser for antal "
-"poster og størrelse.</p>"
