+"…</span> reads supported files in the selected folder and its subfolders. "
+"Unrelated file suffixes are ignored. One import is limited to <b>5,000 "
+"examined files and subfolders</b>, <b>5,000 notes</b>, <b>six subfolder "
+"levels</b>, <b>64 MiB of input files</b> and <b>64 MiB of decoded note "
+"content</b> altogether. If a supported file cannot be read completely or a "
+"limit is exceeded, the whole folder import stops without saving new notes. "
+"Split the export into smaller selections and try again. Folder access is not "
+"retained for later.</p><div class='achtung'><b>A complete desktop archive "
+"does not fit here</b>A <b>.magnolie</b> complete archive from Magnolie "
+"Organizer is deliberately rejected with <i>Complete archive import is not "
+"yet supported on this device.</i> Keep that archive for the desktop "
+"Organizer.</div>"
